trs::rule PO_EX_3_R {
trs::rule_comment PO end-cap extension of ACT when:
trs::rule_comment 1. PO space to L-shape ACT in the same MOS is < 0.14um
trs::rule_comment 2. GATE channel width (W) is >= 0.15um
